{"parentUuid":"6bb68b3c-440c-4e1d-bc92-ebca62fd1c1a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"7ff8a65e-9c1b-4d66-a71c-7c13b0e22e96","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M4A2zcXpcvwS6M4mjNTW4R","type":"tool_result","content":"## Release Preview\n\nThis automated PR was generated by [Callisto](https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto). Merging this PR will publish the updated packages to their release targets.\n\n### 📊 Release Summary\n\n| Package | Ecosystem | Current | Target | Bump | Reason |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `callisto-cli` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Changeset (`bright-leopards-bound`) |\n| `callisto-fixtures` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n| `callisto-graph` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n| `callisto-manifests` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n| `callisto-model` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **5 package(s)** queued for versioning. All changes are backward compatible.\n\n### 📦 What's Changing\n\n_Also bumped with no direct change of their own (released together via a fixed/linked group): `callisto-fixtures`, `callisto-graph`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-model`._\n\n**3 change(s) across 5 package(s):**\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>`bright-leopards-bound`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\n\nRelease tags now record the package that made them and the git tree of each of its directories in the tag message, as Callisto-Package and Callisto-Tree lines. Nothing reads them yet, and tags without them keep working.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>`happy-lions-surge`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\n\nWaiting for npm packages to appear is now one window of confirm-timeout for the whole release: a package that shows up along the way no longer restarts it, and the time spent checking the registry counts, so a slow registry cannot stretch the wait to several windows.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>`swift-owls-read`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\n\n`status`, `version` and `release` skip two history reads for tags made by a recent release. They still read them for every other tag, so older and hand-made tags behave as before.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>Release Workflow Instructions</b></summary>\n\n- **Merging this PR**: Merging into `main` will automatically publish all updated packages to their release registries.\n- **Adding more changesets**: If additional changesets are pushed to `main`, Callisto will automatically re-calculate and update this PR.\n- **Manual edits**: You can make manual adjustments directly on the `main` branch if needed.\n\n</details>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"56e45cdf-2174-4f56-b411-19676d1d774f","timestamp":"2026-10-24T04:06:05.002Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"## Release Preview\n\nThis automated PR was generated by [Callisto](https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto). Merging this PR will publish the updated packages to their release targets.\n\n### 📊 Release Summary\n\n| Package | Ecosystem | Current | Target | Bump | Reason |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `callisto-cli` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Changeset (`bright-leopards-bound`) |\n| `callisto-fixtures` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n| `callisto-graph` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n| `callisto-manifests` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n| `callisto-model` | `core` | `0.14.0` | **`0.14.1`** | 🟢 `patch` | Fixed group `workspace` |\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **5 package(s)** queued for versioning. All changes are backward compatible.\n\n### 📦 What's Changing\n\n_Also bumped with no direct change of their own (released together via a fixed/linked group): `callisto-fixtures`, `callisto-graph`, `callisto-manifests`, `callisto-model`._\n\n**3 change(s) across 5 package(s):**\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>`bright-leopards-bound`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\n\nRelease tags now record the package that made them and the git tree of each of its directories in the tag message, as Callisto-Package and Callisto-Tree lines. Nothing reads them yet, and tags without them keep working.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>`happy-lions-surge`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\n\nWaiting for npm packages to appear is now one window of confirm-timeout for the whole release: a package that shows up along the way no longer restarts it, and the time spent checking the registry counts, so a slow registry cannot stretch the wait to several windows.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>`swift-owls-read`</b> — affects <code>callisto-cli</code></summary>\n\n`status`, `version` and `release` skip two history reads for tags made by a recent release. They still read them for every other tag, so older and hand-made tags behave as before.\n\n</details>\n\n<details>\n<summary><b>Release Workflow Instructions</b></summary>\n\n- **Merging this PR**: Merging into `main` will automatically publish all updated packages to their release registries.\n- **Adding more changesets**: If additional changesets are pushed to `main`, Callisto will automatically re-calculate and update this PR.\n- **Manual edits**: You can make manual adjustments directly on the `main` branch if needed.\n\n</details>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"88859638-03e2-4225-a631-c726cb8f4f37","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","root":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","branch":"docs/cleanup-stale","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"stage