{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01RnkWesCzJyeY97T2UxQPcQ","lastSequenceNum":4761,"ownerAccountUuid":"138d593e-e185-4f72-89f2-82e1a501f134","ownerOrganizationUuid":"602db9b4-428d-49e6-a99c-64152cc62a79"}
{"parentUuid":"f8a1f337-cfbf-4a69-afc6-9b09b27a26c6","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLQFc3tY5GGqq6kS1AjL","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes. #341 and #343 each carry a changeset, and #342 correctly adds none, because it deletes the two hint ones.\n\n| PR | Changeset | Bump |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| #341 look patience | `calm-herons-wait`: a release no longer waits past its confirmation window when a registry keeps asking to retry | `callisto-cli` patch |\n| #343 cleanup | `clear-pens-agree`: `add --package` and `matrix --package` help shows the `ecosystem/name` form | `callisto-cli` patch |\n| #342 hints revert | none; it deletes `bright-leopards-bound` and `swift-owls-read` | n/a |\n\nThe release PR #340 currently lists three changesets: `bright-leopards-bound`, `swift-owls-read` and `happy-lions-surge`. The first two describe the hints, so don't merge #340 as it stands. Once #342 merges, the release PR regenerates and keeps only `happy-lions-surge`. The two new changesets then join it, giving 0.14.1 as a patch with three entries.\n\nTwo things to know:\n- **Changeset wording:** `happy-lions-surge` is the confirmation-window changeset from #337. It sits correctly on main, so nothing is missing there.\n- **#340's \"backward compatible\" note:** it says \"All changes are backward compatible\". That's accurate for these patches."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1853,"cache_read_input_tokens":429927,"output_tokens":461,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1853,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":461,"cache_read_input_tokens":429927,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1853,"ca