{"parentUuid":"fd855435-cd5d-4647-8781-5024e700868b","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-5-5","id":"msg_011CgLQU284Y14vfDrhAnEf8","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The three PRs are now one native GitHub stack (#344), merging bottom to top:\n\n1. **#342** reverts the tag hints, with base `main`.\n2. **#341** keeps a registry look inside the confirmation window, now based on #342.\n3. **#343** is the stale-docs cleanup, now based on #341.\n\n- **Why I stacked all three:** they share files (`access.rs`, `release.json`, `release.md`), and the order matters because #340 must wait for #342. A pairwise merge check showed no conflicts.\n- **How I built it:** I merged each lower branch into the one above it, so nothing was force-pushed. The PR diffs now show only each PR's own change. Squash-merging in order will leave a clean history.\n- **Not checked:** I haven't re-run `just ci` on the two merged branches. GitHub's CI will run on each now.\n- **#340:** it stays outside the stack. Merge it last, after #342 and the rest, and re-trigger its CI first."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_read_input_tokens":434248,"output_tokens":323,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1506,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":323,"cache_read_input_tokens":434248,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1506,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1506},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"e80e8b64-0eaa-4906-a636-a3fad8f14c51","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011C