ualified candidates.\",","new_str":"and a name without its ecosystem exits 1 with E317.\","},"caller":{"type":"direct"}},{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01DLuj1MCLWRkGtgc3DFbnhW","name":"Edit","input":{"file_path":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/docs/specs/matrix.json","old_string":"are keyed by the package's display id: the bare name, or `<ecosystem>/<name>` when packages in two ecosystems share that name, so a cargo crate","new_str":"are keyed by the package's `<ecosystem>/<name>` id for its primary ecosystem, so a cargo crate"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}]}}
