mpty `changesets` list, then stages the file with git; under `--dry-run` it prints the content and writes nothing. For promoted packages, an older bare key is assigned to the unique historical owner at the commit that added pre.json; if no unique owner exists, version fails with E245.\"","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"VER-PRE-02\","]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"staleRecovered":true,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"57e55afb-784a-4e86-abb9-dd9b340b1d66","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"docs/spec-drift","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
