{"parentUuid":"ba84f8b0-baa0-4541-bcca-8cd95ade45da","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"611a0958-8088-4957-ad50-7eed36897c7a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_016xYdWzSvW5Qg75Cxz1jmYJ","type":"tool_result","content":"/// and has no concept of hostRunner/useCross, so this cannot be derived from\n/// it. Returns `None` for any triple `triple_to_role` does not recognise --\n/// callers must treat that as the unrecognised-triple diagnostic path, never a silent\n/// default.\npub(crate) fn triple_host_runner_use_cross(triple: &str) -> Option<(&'static str, bool)> {\n    Some(match triple {\n        \"aarch64-apple-darwin\" => (\"macos-latest\", false),\n        \"x86_64-apple-darwin\" => (\"macos-13\", false),\n        \"x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", false),\n        \"x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"aarch64-unknown-linux-musl\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\" => (\"windows-latest\", false),\n        \"i686-pc-windows-msvc\" => (\"windows-latest\", false),\n        \"aarch64-pc-windows-msvc\" => (\"windows-latest\", false),\n        \"armv7-unknown-linux-gnueabihf\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"x86_64-unknown-freebsd\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"aarch64-linux-android\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"armv7-linux-androideabi\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"riscv64gc-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"powerpc64le-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"s390x-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"wasm32-wasip1\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", false),\n# proto plugin: installs the callisto CLI from GitHub release assets.\n# .prototools: [plugins.tools] callisto = \"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/orin-dx/callisto/main/proto/callisto.toml\"\nname = \"callisto\"\ntype = \"cli\"\n\n[platform.macos]\narchs = [\"aarch64\"]\ndownload-file = \"callisto-{arch}-apple-darwin.tar.gz\"\nexe-path = \"callisto\"\n\n[platform.linux]\narchs = [\"x86_64\"]\ndownload-file = \"callisto-{arch}-unknown-linux-{libc}.tar.gz\"\nexe-path = \"callisto\"\n\n[install]\ndownload-url = \"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/releases/download/callisto@{version}/{download_file}\"\n\n[resolve]\ngit-url = \"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto\"\nversion-pattern = \"^callisto@(?<major>\\\\d+)\\\\.(?<minor>\\\\d+)\\\\.(?<patch>\\\\d+)(?:-(?<pre>[0-9A-Za-z.-]+))?$\"\ntarget = \"x86_64-apple-darwin\"\nasset-name = \"callisto-x86_64-apple-darwin.tar.gz\"\n\n[[release.artifact]]\npackage = \"cargo/callisto-cli\"\ntarget = \"x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\"\nasset-name = \"callisto-x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz\"\n\n[[release.artifact]]\npackage = \"cargo/callisto-cli\"\ntarget = \"aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu\"\nasset-name = \"callisto-aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu.tar.gz\"\n\n[[release.artifact]]\npackage = \"cargo/callisto-cli\"\ntarget = \"x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\"\nasset-name = \"callisto-x86_64-unknown-linux-musl.tar.gz\"\n\n[cascade]","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"4c038878-606d-4dfc-8b9a-38092ccf8dc5","timestamp":"2026-10-24T06:34:52.989Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"/// and has no concept of hostRunner/useCross, so this cannot be derived from\n/// it. Returns `None` for any triple `triple_to_role` does not recognise --\n/// callers must treat that as the unrecognised-triple diagnostic path, never a silent\n/// default.\npub(crate) fn triple_host_runner_use_cross(triple: &str) -> Option<(&'static str, bool)> {\n    Some(match triple {\n        \"aarch64-apple-darwin\" => (\"macos-latest\", false),\n        \"x86_64-apple-darwin\" => (\"macos-13\", false),\n        \"x86_64-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", false),\n        \"x86_64-unknown-linux-musl\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"aarch64-unknown-linux-gnu\" => (\"ubuntu-latest\", true),\n        \"aarch64-unkn