{"parentUuid":"41877167-d935-4086-ae3e-294a3c7f137a","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"611a0958-8088-4957-ad50-7eed36897c7a","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TkTTSeh2GurL6frFtcxP4d","type":"tool_result","content":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/348\nTwo release-target facts were out of date now that Intel macOS and arm64 Linux binaries are published.\n\nThe GitHub release of a package in a fixed group only carried that package's own changelog section. When a changeset names another member, the release owner's section is just \"Released together with the `lockstep` fixed group\", so the notes said nothing about the change.\n\nCorrects the criteria in the five specs that no longer match the code. All 249 criteria were checked against the code, `docs/errors.md` and the 0.14 binary on scratch repos. Most held; 20 were wrong, incomplete or inconsistent.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"3ceee491-617c-4944-a977-5592ecf8251d","timestamp":"2026-10-24T06:39:34.913Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/348\nTwo release-target facts were out of date now that Intel macOS and arm64 Linux binaries are published.\n\nThe GitHub release of a package in a fixed group only carried that package's own changelog section. When a changeset names another member, the release owner's section is just \"Released together with the `lockstep` fixed group\", so the notes said nothing about the change.\n\nCorrects the criteria in the five specs that no longer match the code. All 249 criteria were checked against the code, `docs/errors.md` and the 0.14 binary on scratch repos. Most held; 20 were wrong, incomplete or inconsistent.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false,"dangerouslyDisableSandbox":true,"gitOperation":{"pr":{"number":348,"url":"https://github.com/orin-dx/callisto/pull/348","action":"edited"}}},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"333e6cc4-c0bc-4b3f-8581-bdcb9a79830f","context