pped with a warning and init succeeds. After writing, init prints that merging to the default branch publishes, advises requiring pull requests and reviews on it, and lists the next steps: the repository secrets for the detected registries, `callisto add`, `callisto release --dry-run` and the first-publish guide.\"","     },","     {","       \"id\": \"CLI-WF-02\","]}],"userModified":false,"replaceAll":false,"contentNotInModelContext":true},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"07a3d2ae-d953-436f-8e7f-fb3457155c0c","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/init-defaults","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
