{"parentUuid":"d5a9ffb2-84d6-4dc1-954b-dab8ff67a6bb","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"292a1ddc-3040-4aad-8fec-ec43ab952564","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012dhTKTq8EVxBFRb95ydBqh","type":"tool_result","content":"File created successfully at: /Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.changeset/easy-lions-start.md (file state is current in your context — no need to Read it back)"}]},"uuid":"f658cb56-1fad-4d7d-8580-1e6b8c29ef8f","timestamp":"2026-10-24T17:54:04.099Z","toolUseResult":{"type":"create","filePath":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main/.changeset/easy-lions-start.md","content":"---\ncallisto-cli: minor\n---\n\n`callisto init --yes` now works with no other flags: packages version independently unless `--versioning fixed` is given, and a GitHub repository gets the release workflow unless `--no-workflow` is given. A single package is no longer asked how to version. If the unrequested workflow cannot be built, such as offline, `init` skips it with a warning instead of failing. After writing the workflow, `init` lists the repository secrets to add and the first commands to run, and the publishing guide has new sections on first publishes and on pulling a release.\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null,"userModified":false},"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"d5a9ffb2-84d6-4dc1-954b-dab8ff67a6bb","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"mode"},"session_id":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","sessionKind":"bg","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/gabe/Projects/callisto/.claude/worktrees/smoke-main","sessionId":"15c732d1-457b-4efc-91e5-664943f21b1c","version":"2.1.304","gitBranch":"feat/init-defaults","slug":"lexical-jingling-puppy"}
